post.description:
Create a new scan job.

The scan will be executed asynchronously in the background.
Use GET /scan-jobs/{job_id} to check status and retrieve results.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "source_type": "csv",
  "source_config": {
    "filepath": "test_data/sample_customers.csv",
    "delimiter": ","
  },
  "scan_options": {
    "include_quality": true,
    "include_pii": true,
    "sample_size": null
  }
}
```

**Response:** Job details with status "pending"
